flowchart LR
    U[Solution consultant] --> UI[Streamlit web frontend]
    UI --> UP[MCL Excel upload]
    UI --> LP[Lease Documents folder or file uploads]
    UP --> ING[Workbook ingestion and header normalization]
    LP --> READ[PDF / DOCX / TXT text extraction]
    ING --> G[LangGraph workflow]
    READ --> G
    G --> Q[Query planning<br/>LLM optional; rules fallback]
    Q --> E[Lease evidence extraction<br/>LLM optional; labeled-date rules fallback]
    E --> M[Deterministic MCL-to-lease matching<br/>lease no. / SO; term + start date fallback]
    ING --> M
    M --> R[Renewal results and review flags]
    R --> XLSX[Excel report<br/>Summary + Renewal Results]
    XLSX --> UI
    UI --> D[Download report]
